<!-- ══ HOW IT WORKS ═════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section id="how">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="label">How it works</span>
      <h2>From any phone to a walkable model.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <article class="step">
        <span class="n">01 — CAPTURE</span>
        <h3>Guided photo checklist</h3>
        <p>The room owner walks the space following on-screen framing prompts. The app flags missing coverage and blurry shots before upload.</p>
        <p class="meta">No LiDAR · no tripod<br>~4 minutes</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step">
        <span class="n">02 — RECONSTRUCTION</span>
        <h3>AI 3D reconstruction</h3>
        <p>Our computer vision pipeline estimates pose, depth and geometry, returning a textured mesh at metric scale with its dimensioned floor plan.</p>
        <p class="meta">Cloud processing<br>Real metres</p>
      </article>
      <article class="step">
        <span class="n">03 — WALKTHROUGH</span>
        <h3>Published walkthrough</h3>
        <p>The model is embedded in the listing. Renters step in, look around, measure and decide before booking a train, a bus or a flight.</p>
        <p class="meta">Web · mobile<br>VR</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

